@id: mkt:google-login
@stratum: L1
@uses: @marketplace/google-oauth-identity@2.4.0
@tag: pii, user_data
@substrate: Viewport:TodoList

Capability: Sign in with Google (Marketplace Blueprint)
  Quantifier: For ANY feature that stores or mutates user_data, bind the operation to a verified Google OAuth identity token.

  Scenario: Reject unauthenticated task mutations
    Given an anonymous request with an empty or expired identity token
    When the request attempts to create or complete a todo task
    Then the operation is rejected with Unauthorized
